{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20707","headline":"赋花 · 张籍","name":"赋花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花，花。\n落早，开赊。\n对酒客，兴诗家。\n能回游骑，每驻行车。\n宛宛清风起，茸茸丽日斜。\n且愿相留懽洽，惟愁虚弃光华。\n明年攀折知不远，对此谁能更叹嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}